      "created_at": "2016-04-25T21:25:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Scholar of the Infinite likes Reckless very much.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In general, Mindbreaker, Seeker, and Indiscriminate tandom very well together. &nbsp;Although the heroes end up taking a lot of damage too.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But do you know who likes the Seeker the most? &nbsp;O-X's Defensive Blast. &nbsp;With a boost from Indiscriminate, you can easily deal 4 damage to every villain 3 times (or until everyone is dead).</p>",
