      "id": 174302,
      "name": "The Burning Stickman",
      "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-04-25T21:36:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had some fun getting Chaos Lord on Chrono Ranger. Every time he took damage, he hit them right back.</p><p>Contrived things to get Stonejaw on a Platform Bot that made it the next best thing to invincible. Now if only Stealth Bot had been in my hand that turn...</p><p>But really fun? The Indiscriminate, The Seeker and Living Weapon on Tempest. 2 HP global Lightning Storm to start the round, followed by a 6-HP hitting Squall.</p><p>Reckless on the Scholar with Alchemical Redirection would be insane.</p><p>Or just having Mindbreaker in play with Captain Cosmic out -- a few Dynamic Syphons out and extra powers out the wazoo. He'd also benefit from having Reckless -- it would essentially remove the upkeep cost of Unflagging Animation, provided he wasn't buffed.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:57:38.456Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
